title: Proposition 11
---
order: 11
---
short_label: IX.11
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If as many numbers as we please beginning from a unit are in continued proportion, then the less measures the greater according to some one of the numbers which appear among the proportional numbers.
----
proof:

Let there be as many numbers as we please, *B, C, D,* and *E,* beginning from the unit *A* and in continued proportion.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="250" height="200" tabindex="0"></canvas>
